  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 506.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 506.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the minimum requirements for the opening of seasonal public water systems (seasonal systems).\n\nSource. #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by #14342, eff 8-22-25, EXPIRES: 8-22-35",
